#lego-legacy-route 1
# LEGO Rock Raiders, from its boot to its main menu: first light, as #12 names it.
#
# Nothing on the way is pressed. The setup dialog's default button is pressed
# by the machine, as a person pressing Enter would; both movies play to their
# end; the title loads its objects with the loading screen up from flip 4135,
# the first frame after its movies; and at flip 4603 it presents its main menu,
# which it then draws every flip while it waits.
#
# The pointer then moves onto Start Game, which the title lights up; the title
# reads where the pointer is. Then it moves to an empty corner of the menu and
# clicks, which reaches the title as its window's messages and leaves it in
# its menu.
flip 4610 move 320 222
flip 4618 move 40 460
flip 4620 down
flip 4622 up
